    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/nfdi4cat/goldbook-skos/blame/main/vocabularies/goldbook/IDs12xxx/12848.ttl> ;
    skos:definition "Molecule belonging mainly to the immunoglobulins, integrin superfamily (e.g., LFA-1, ICAM-1) or selectins, expressed on the cell membrane of various cells including those of the immune system. Interaction of adhesion molecules with each other as receptor and corresponding ligand facilitates cooperation (cross-talk) of cells, signal transduction, and information transfer between cells."@en ;
    skos:inScheme goldbook: ;
    skos:prefLabel "adhesion molecule"@en ;
